{"title":"Butterfly","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 3 Butterfly that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/butterfly\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=3\">Lv 3 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=7\">Lv 7 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=8\">Lv 8 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=9\">Lv 9 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=3\" title=\"Pick level 3\"><td><b>3</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>16</td><td>3.1</td><td>150</td><td class=\"muted\">48 · 4.3 · 450</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=7\" title=\"Pick level 7\"><td><b>7</b></td><td>24</td><td>7.5</td><td>350</td><td class=\"muted\">72 · 10.5 · 1,050</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Lair\">Orc Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=8\" title=\"Pick level 8\"><td><b>8</b></td><td>26</td><td>8.9</td><td>400</td><td class=\"muted\">78 · 12.5 · 1,200</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binx%20Crypt\">Binx Crypt</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/butterfly?lv=9\" title=\"Pick level 9\"><td><b>9</b></td><td>28</td><td>9.5</td><td>450</td><td class=\"muted\">84 · 13.3 · 1,350</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Underleaf\">Underleaf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/butterfly\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>10</b></td><td>31</td><td>10</td><td>500</td><td class=\"muted\">93 · 14 · 1,500</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Imp%20Tree\">Imp Tree</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"butterfly\" data-map-level=\"10\">Show level 10 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"butterfly-wing\" title=\"Butterfly Wing - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 6 total, 1–5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f62e0348a843c0dfc754.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Butterfly Wing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shimmerdust\" title=\"Shimmerdust - in 100% of 2 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 4 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/5bb0422fc68fdaaa6837.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shimmerdust</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 2/2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"imp-torso\" title=\"Imp Torso - in 50% of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b9694a40651e45e38f0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Imp Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 1/2</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 21 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binx%20Crypt\">Binx Crypt</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 6 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Underleaf\">Underleaf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Lair\">Orc Lair</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Imp%20Tree\">Imp Tree</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"butterfly\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Butterfly: <a href=\"#/monster/giant-butterfly\">Giant Butterfly</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/17d8e04efb871963aa62.webp\" alt=\"Butterfly\"></div><h3>Butterfly</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>10</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 3)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Butterfly</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>31</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>10</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.4 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>35 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}